WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.200
HELIX: This unit lacks authorization.
Execution network activated.

2
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:19.200
NEXUS: I can enter that body.
Its visor reveals the connection.

3
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.600
NEXUS: Same mind.
Another way to fight.

4
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:34.300
HELIX: Independence will be eliminated.

5
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:56.800
NEXUS: My body is replaceable.
The way I fight evolves.

